WEBVTT

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:28.170
Thank you for watching until the end.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:37.720
Awaken, spread your wings, it's time to set off, Dougram

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:47.040
Connecting the chains, breaking through, binding your heart

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:55.680
Cutting through the darkness, the warrior of light, Dougram

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.230
Aim for the distant horizon

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:05.390
Baby!

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:46.830
The iron arm is gone. The iron leg has lost its power.

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:51.170
The hazy one will never blow fire again.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:58.240
The iron warrior is dead. The wolf is also dead.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.350
The dead have died, too. Those who hold their fangs in their hearts have all passed away.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:36.880
Oh

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.580
A warrior of light

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:44.660
5, 4, 3, 2, 1,

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:45.720
Let's go!

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:02.890
Thank you.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:30.630
Let's go!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.310
This Dam City is a small force of mine.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.470
However, if the supply supplies arrive at the Dankuga base of the Federation Army here,

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.500
the freight train will reverse.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.960
Therefore, the freight train will be transferred to the Dankuga base...

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:07.020
Therefore, Deloyer 7 wants to attack the train in this red valley and stop it from refueling.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:14.340
The estimated enemy's force is 50 soldiers per armored vehicle, but other than that...

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.110
What's the matter, Nasu?

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.920
A huge star just flew by.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:24.310
Idiot! Don't scare me! Why would a shooting star fly by?

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.280
Look! It flew by again!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.710
It's beautiful, Nasu!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.300
Oh, you're a poet.

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:52.810
I'll confirm the strategy. Chico, can you hear me?

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.510
Okay, I can hear you.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:59.220
I'll stop the target. Chico, ask for a security vehicle.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.680
I think there are two of them in front and two in the back.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:08.190
Billy, if any reinforcements come from up there...

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.990
Hey! Get out of the way!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.230
I'll stop the reinforcements.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.760
Crinn, how's the Ragnar's condition?

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:15.560
Good.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.890
All right. When it starts, get out at once.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:19.790
Okay.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.600
Fester, did you find a good spot?

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:23.640
Perfect.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:26.110
You're the only one with the anti-ship force.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.400
Don't miss the timing of the attack.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.460
Okay.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:31.710
Canary, how's the radar?

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:35.770
It's OK. We can cover an area of 20 km radius with this.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.470
But it's far away. Neither enemy nor ally has the radar.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.800
X-Nebula is lucky.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.090
There's no abnormality in Mokka.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:53.360
It disappeared.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.220
The city is indeed a very important place for strategy.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.580
and the supply to the base is urgent.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.390
But I want you to understand that your mission is not there.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.240
The sun's wings will be destroyed if we don't.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.240
To put it bluntly, the train is a precious decoy.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:19.620
Miguel, you and your team will be responsible for this.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.100
I repeat, I'm counting on you.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.700
Yes, sir. Please look forward to the result.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:32.880
Let's go!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:43.640
We'll repeat the battle!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:47.390
Our mission is not to protect the train and its fuel supplies.

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:51.530
It is to defeat the sun's fangs!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:57.120
And before the train attacks, we'll take a 20km distance and advance.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.980
The train will be attacked, and we'll increase the distance...

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.970
The S.O.S. will be dispatched by the S.O.S. for communication.

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:05.340
We'll go to the site and shoot the sun's fangs.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:08.730
If the operation succeeds, it'll be a special mission for the second class.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:09.470
Get ready!

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:34.270
Thank you for your viewing.

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:34.840
Alright, here we go!

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:37.050
Miss, I'll carry the luggage.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.570
I can't stand to see a beautiful woman suffering.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:42.890
Hey, say something.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.850
What? I was dumped.

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.030
The second one is out of shape.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:58.360
What time will the next flight leave?

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:06.450
The next train to Dam City is a temporary military train, so it's three o'clock two hours late.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.440
Please go to Dam City.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.650
Are you alone?

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:11.630
Yes.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:18.100
I don't know what you're doing, but that's not a place for a young girl like you to go.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.840
Dam City is currently under the control of the guerrillas.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:25.290
From what I've seen, you're from Earth, aren't you?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.750
Yes, but I really want to go.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.410
Hmm, don't say anything bad!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:30.800
Then you'd better not go!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.490
It's not that Chiyagawa is the worst, but that place is a battlefield.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.880
Well, there's no guarantee that the train will arrive at Dumb City.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.290
I won't say anything bad.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.050
Get out of here!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:44.260
Thank you.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:45.980
But I have no choice but to go.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:49.860
Thank you for watching!

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.280
Excuse me. You're from Earth, aren't you?

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:07.600
Yes.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.510
I'm from Earth, too.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:11.730
May I ask you a question?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:16.480
Where are you from?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:17.980
Medol.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:19.470
Medol?

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.740
Are you from Medol?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:22.680
Yes.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.330
Excuse me.

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.360
Medol is the capital of the classical world.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.900
It might be ideal for a human to live in a place like that.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:38.380
But why is a young man like you going to Dam City again?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.290
I have someone I want to meet.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.380
I heard he was in Dam City, so I came.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.920
Oh, you're from Earth.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.800
In such a remote land.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.840
No, I also have young people I want to meet in Dam City.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:56.100
One of them is a young man from Medol, just like you.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.240
From Medol?

00:10:57.700 --> 00:10:59.380
I have a dream about those young people.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.080
I've been dreaming about my own dream.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:15.950
I'm going to take this train as a heavy-duty train driver.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:19.060
If you're interested, I'd like to see you at my wife's place.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:19.820
See you!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:47.740
Okay.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.030
How much more do I have to go?

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:49.800
5 minutes left.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.600
The temple is right up there!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:52.760
It's fucking hot.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.840
If you have a lot of money, go home and drink beer at the usual store.

00:11:58.790 --> 00:11:59.990
Don't just stand there, show me what you got!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.660
Anyway, there's coffee in the cooler.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.460
Thank you very much.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:09.680
By the way, what I'm really worried about is Chico's head.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.680
Because it's self-defense.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.200
It's okay. I'm used to it.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.130
It's time. Everyone, stop moving from now on.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:19.980
All right.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:38.730
All right, perfect.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:49.680
It's a self-propelled vehicle.

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:52.410
It won't do anything if you blow that thing away.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:53.970
Go now.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:55.430
Huh?

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:59.240
I'm waiting.

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:00.540
Did you find the criminal?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.030
Thank you for watching!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:59.370
It's hot. I'm sweating like hell.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.990
Mr. Bunya, if you were an entertainer on Earth, it would be easy for you.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:10.670
I'm not interested in such a world that is full of filth.

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:15.810
What I want to know is the truth and the possibilities of humans.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:16.660
You're right.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.430
What we have here is only stupidity and stupidity.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:26.140
All Mr. Bunya sees is stupidity and despair.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.080
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:36.320
I, Deloyer, have come to see the truth and the future of humanity that I want to know.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:39.400
I'll see it and write it down. I believe in it!

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:00.530
Cheat!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.700
Thank you.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:52.890
This vehicle is getting in the way!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.660
Stop the car!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:14.760
We've captured the SOS.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.740
We'll head for the target via a submarine flight.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:18.400
We'll contact the enemy in 5 minutes.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:37.000
Distance 13. We'll be in contact in 2 minutes.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:38.410
It's gone!

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:41.400
Why? What's going on?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.060
Rocky!

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.440
Hurry up!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:53.000
There's an enemy on the left.

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:56.720
Oh no! Taniyo is in the air!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.320
Shinji, can you hear me? Are you okay?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.960
I'm not sure about now.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.480
From now on, I don't have much confidence in myself.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:59.960
Then, let's go to the other side.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.620
Don't move! I'm right below you!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:03.440
Roger that!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:14.460
I'll show you what I've got!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:37.650
If we fight from the front, we'll be dead. Don't overdo it.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.230
Leave the helicopter to me. You wait for Crinn's support.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.070
Got it!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.930
Damned! Don't let him go!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.800
Gamble! Gamble!

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.630
His armor is hot! We can't penetrate at that distance!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.500
Shoot at close range!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.100
Hey! Let go! Let go!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.360
Thank you for watching!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:10.420
The punishment has been decided!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:30.980
We'll be right back.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.510
It's time for Wazuki to return to the base!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:08.220
He's running away!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.420
Chiko, you saved us earlier!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.620
We're both lost!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:13.400
Who is it?

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.560
Raise your hands and come out!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:15.960
It's me!

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:20.970
Mr. Bunya, what are you doing here?

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.360
I thought I could meet you guys if I went to Dam City.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:25.960
I was on a military train,

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:29.710
but when I came here, I was shocked.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.580
That's why we're all here.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:40.330
The mission was a success.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.330
I'll let you know as soon as possible.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.180
Be careful.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:50.250
This is the best way to get a long-distance communication.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.170
What a unique planet.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.580
Come to think of it,

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.040
I met a girl from Medor, just like you, at the station ahead.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.280
I was about the same age as you.

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:11.720
According to the contact I just entered, the ship to Dam City will not leave for the time being.

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:12.660
What?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.070
There was a destruction operation of Delilah in the red valley 30 kilometers away.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.900
Well, depending on how you think, you may be lucky.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:22.610
I can't go to that town.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:41.480
Colonel, it seems that the plan was a failure.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:48.050
It won't get that serious. I'm already used to it.

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:53.610
Oh, I see.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:21:59.350
After all, the child is a lion.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:07.580
Kurin, don't get in my way. I don't have time.

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:08.880
I don't have time!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.700
East! East!

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:15.100
South! South!

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.580
North! South!

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:29.980
The youth that runs, the youth that waits, the youth that chases...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:35.320
The youth that cries, the youth that cries, the youth that runs through the unknown.

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:41.480
The time of fire has passed, but the story must be told.

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:43.820
Forever.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.620
Not justice. I want to get truth.

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:55.820
Why the iron warrior who dies in the wilderness?

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:57.940
Who is the girl who chases the wind?

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.360
A young man like a wolf,

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:02.420
a young man like a lion,

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:05.260
runs the land of Deloyer.

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.710
The story began with a single gunshot.

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:12.260
Next time, the gunshot begins.

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:15.850
Not justice, I want to get truth.

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:17.640
Can you see the truth?

00:23:34.600 --> 00:23:51.670
星が流れて 願いをかけて 二つ数えて 夢くだらけ

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:57.710
恋しさヘラノ

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:16.220
brush my
